<PARA INFOID = "T030010A096" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "12Sep2003"     INFOTYPE = "PARTS" INDSW = "ON"     SELECT = "Vehicle Outline: Power Performance">
<TITLE>Automatic Transaxle Outline</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>On 2AZ-FE engine models, the K112 type automatic transaxle "Super CVT-i" has been adopted for 2WD models and the K112F type for 4WD models.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The K112 and K112F automatic transaxles are automatic transaxles that adopt an electro-hydraulically controlled steel belt type continuously variable transmission mechanism. They achieve both class-leading low fuel consumption and the smooth driving feel of a belt type continuously variable transmission mechanism at a high level. Furthermore, the latest controls such as sport sequential Shiftmatic control have been adopted, ensuring excellent fuel economy and drivability.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
